Z||000002||stimpy||05-09-2000||11:43 PM||||I'd like to see how it was done. I tried with an EL series 6.5" Bazooka attached to the bottom of the dash with straps. Killed the legroom on the passenger side and was thief bait due to beig exposed. I sure do miss my Sony powered subwoofer tube that I had mounted on the floor in front of my pasenger seat. Just the right size to put the legs over, had built in gain, delay and level controls. Damn thieves!! (sniff)||||reg||1
Z||000003||turbo86se||05-10-2000||04:52 AM||||The 5.25" bazooka tubes fit perfectly behind the seats. From what I've heard they're discontinued, but I found a guy on ebay with lots of new sets for sale for $100. You can't put the seats all the way back, since I'm only 5'5", it's no problem!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>I haven't gotten them installed yet, but I can't wait!!||||reg||1
